                <invention-title lang="de">KAPSELANORDNUNG FÜR GETRÄNKEMASCHINE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">ENSEMBLE CAPSULE POUR MACHINE À BOISSONS</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">POD ASSEMBLY FOR BEVERAGE MACHINE</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A beverage pod for a beverage machine is provided. The beverage pod can include a container having an internal space and a container flange defining an opening to the internal space, a plug sealing the opening of the container, and a cap secured to the container flange. A beverage medium can be located within the internal space of the container. The cap can be operable to selectively engage a portion of the plug to release the beverage medium through the plug and the cap.</p>
            </abstract>
